'use strict';
// ===== The Season 1 finale (Mon Nov 2 2026, 1:50 PM; it opens Season 2): =====
// Infinity Ultron lands; Doctor Doom fights him and falls; the Avengers (Iron Man, Cap, Hulk, Strange) team
// up and almost win until Ultron's forehead laser drops them all; LeBron dunks on Ultron from behind, walks
// through his laser behind Cap's shield, rips off the Gauntlet and snaps everyone back. Then the Death Star
// arrives and charges its laser: everyone has 30 s to board an evac ship (jetpacks on) before the island is
// destroyed, then hyperspace and Season 2.
// Runs live in the hangout off the real clock (seeded, fixed steps), like the Ultron event, so everyone sees
